{"product_id":"if-it-bleeds","title":"If It Bleeds","description":"\u003cp data-end=\"503\" data-start=\"181\"\u003eStep into the world of suspense, mystery, and supernatural twists with \u003cem data-end=\"266\" data-start=\"252\"\u003eIf It Bleeds\u003c\/em\u003e, a collection of four gripping novellas from the master of horror himself, Stephen King. This book isn’t just about scares—it’s about stories that linger, that make you question what’s real, and what’s lurking just beyond the shadows.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"594\" data-start=\"505\"\u003eIn these four tales, King takes you from small-town eeriness to the edge of human fear:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"596\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"733\" data-start=\"596\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"733\" data-start=\"598\"\u003eMr. Harrigan’s Phone – A story of friendship, technology, and the chilling consequences of keeping secrets from beyond the grave.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"865\" data-start=\"734\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"865\" data-start=\"736\"\u003eThe Life of Chuck – A poignant, sometimes darkly humorous look at one man’s life and the mysterious moments that define it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1086\" data-start=\"866\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1086\" data-start=\"868\"\u003eIf It Bleeds – Featuring Holly Gibney, the beloved detective from King’s \u003cem data-end=\"966\" data-start=\"945\"\u003eBill Hodges Trilogy\u003c\/em\u003e, this novella blends crime, suspense, and supernatural terror in a story that keeps you guessing until the last page.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1087\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1089\"\u003eRat – A writer makes a desperate deal with fate itself, only to discover that inspiration can come at a terrifying cost.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1539\" data-start=\"1217\"\u003eKing’s signature style is here in full force: deeply human characters, nail-biting tension, and moments of startling clarity that make the supernatural feel all too real. Whether you’re a longtime fan or a first-time reader, \u003cem data-end=\"1456\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003eIf It Bleeds\u003c\/em\u003e delivers stories that haunt, thrill, and stay with you long after the last page.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions:33 x 171 \u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Stephen King \u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9781982179724 \u003cbr\u003eFormat: hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43840888242329,"sku":"9RA9781982179724","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/91Kk49IWRmL._SL1500.jpg?v=1724164181","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/if-it-bleeds","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}